    text: (You hear some strange, uneven noises coming from the cellphone.)
  - speaker: Caller
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e48b250aad4258b41864c8d191a2c3f3, type: 3}
    text: (The noises continue, but you can faintly hear a car passing by in the
      background.)
  - speaker: Caller
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e48b250aad4258b41864c8d191a2c3f3, type: 3}
    text: (Then, footsteps begin to grow louder and louder.)
  - speaker: Caller
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e48b250aad4258b41864c8d191a2c3f3, type: 3}
    text: Oh, am I still on the call?
  - speaker: Caller
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e48b250aad4258b41864c8d191a2c3f3, type: 3}
    text: Could you please disconnect me?
